      "All 4 ISP international gateways unreachable from external probes (TIC 2.187.1.1: connection refused, TIC 78.38.112.1: timeout, Irancell 5.232.0.1: connection refused, Asiatech 94.182.0.1: timeout) while foreign-platform HTTP probes reach Google/YouTube/GitHub in 60-178ms — centralized DPI whitelisting at national gateway layer, consistent with Bock et al. FOCI'20 whitelister architecture",
